## SQ-PS15-03 | SaltLayerVanishChance 1.0: 20 ice under a 1-layer salt layer (L1), beside a Salt Block (L2), beside a 1-layer salt layer (L3)
@group A
@commands `[salt.Melting] SaltLayerVanishChance` 1.0, then 0.0 (restart each): 20 ice each under a 1-layer salt layer and 20 ice each beside a Salt Block; wait for all to melt
@pass 1.0: every 1-layer salt layer air after its ice melts, every Salt Block stays; 0.0: no layer lost; default 0.05: about 1 of 20
@fails key present in `config/creativedelight-common.toml` and `configs_edited/`; `Melting.setSaltMeltListener` set (CD `SaltLayerMelt.init`); CD reads the field by reflection (needs Salt -04)
