## SQ-PS15-05 | full lick with a 2-layer salt layer, cow licks 3 times (interval 200, chance 1.0); player licks a stack (8 + 1 layers) twice
@group A
@commands Full Salt Block lick with a salt layer of 2 on top; stage chance 1.0; a cow licks it 3 times; then a full lick under a stack of an 8-layer salt block and a 1-layer salt block, player licks at chance 1.0 twice
@pass layers 2 -> 1 -> air, the lick stays `salt:salt_block`; the third lick makes it lightly licked; stack: the 1-layer block goes first, then the 8-layer one becomes 7
@fails `SaltLick.wear` / `topLayer`
@from batches/r1116/ps15_a.qb
> fill 339 -61 349 342 -58 351 minecraft:glass hollow
> setblock 340 -60 350 salt:salt_block
> setblock 340 -59 350 vintagedelight:salt[layers=2]
> zmelt clear
> zmelt w lick overworld 340 -60 350
> zmelt w layer overworld 340 -59 350
> summon minecraft:cow 341 -60 350.5 {Tags:["ps05"],PersistenceRequired:1b}
