## SQ-PS15-06 | salt dust onto worn licks (hand, dispenser, layer above), waxed by dispenser, full lick by hand and by dispenser
@group A
@commands Salt dust onto a worn lick: by hand, by dispenser, as a layer above (`/setblock` a layer of 2 on heavily licked); waxed heavily licked by dispenser; then onto a full lick by hand and by dispenser
@pass worn: one stage per salt in all three (layer of 2: two stages, layer gone); waxed: waxed well licked; full: a salt layer on top (dispenser: dust -1)
@fails `SaltLick.refill`, `addLayerOnTop`
