> cdevtest count 402 -60 402 418 -45 418 #minecraft:leaves
bootexpect \[creativeworldgen\] mod data packs on: \[[^]]*upgrade_aquatic
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=count .*ids=[^ ]*minecraft:oak_log
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=count .*upgrade_aquatic:river_log
look tree placed (place feature reply in the log); logs = oak only; leaves = mulberry (upgrade_aquatic:mulberry_leaves or the override id); the river walk (mulberry trees, driftwood) needs a group B world: not run here
## SQ-PS15-16c | IW coral growth guard: the 11 ua_*_coral growths load only with Upgrade Aquatic; no unknown coral id ERROR without it
@group A
@commands Guard for the Immersive Weathering coral growths of Upgrade Aquatic corals (TODO `tooling/scratch-1115-follow-ups-2 #15`): the 11 `ua_*_coral.json` moved from `kubejs/data/immersive_weathering/block_growths/` into Creative Worldgen `packs/immersive_weathering+upgrade_aquatic/` (build 2026-11-17; generator `ua_coral_growths` writes there). Boot 1, full pack: `grep -n "mod data packs on" logs/latest.log`; `grep -c "ua_.*_coral\|upgrade_aquatic:.*_coral" logs/latest.log`; SQ-UC-01 (growth files parse) as written. Boot 2 as SQ-PS15-16b (`upgrade_aquatic` and `alexsabnormalities` out of a scratch `mods/`, fresh world): the same two greps
@pass boot 1: `immersive_weathering+upgrade_aquatic` in the `on` list, no ERROR line naming a `ua_*_coral` file, SQ-UC-01 PASS; boot 2: `Done (`, `immersive_weathering+upgrade_aquatic` in the `off` list, 0 ERROR lines naming `ua_*_coral` or `upgrade_aquatic:*_coral` (r1116: 11)
@fails boot 2 still logs the 11 errors: the old files are still in `kubejs/data/immersive_weathering/block_growths/` (stale copy in the scratch instance) or the Worldgen jar is older than 2026-11-17; boot 1 growths missing: the pack folder name split (`+`) or the pack is off because Immersive Weathering's mod id differs; any other ERROR naming upgrade_aquatic: grep its path and guard that file the same way
@draft no batch holds this row yet; pairs with SQ-PS15-16b (same boots)

@@section 2
@@title SQ-PS15 / CQ-PS15 Melting G7 and G8: melt ticks, snow by layer, magma, saltable, slow tier frozen, 2026-11-17 ([plan_post_scratch_1115.md](../plan_post_scratch_1115.md) G7, G8; [melting.md](../melting.md); TODO `tooling/scratch-1115-follow-ups #20`)
@@date 2026-11-17
