## SQ-PS15-24 | a torch lights an unlit campfire and is used up; a soul torch only a soul campfire
@group A
@commands Survival player with 2 torches and 2 soul torches. Under a roof: place a campfire and a soul campfire (both unlit, Unlit Campfire). Right click the campfire with a soul torch; then with a torch. Right click the soul campfire with a torch; then with a soul torch. A third campfire waterlogged: right click with a torch
@pass soul torch on the campfire: nothing, nothing used; torch: campfire lit, 1 torch used; torch on the soul campfire: nothing; soul torch: lit, 1 used; waterlogged campfire stays unlit, nothing used
@fails lit by the wrong torch: `soulflameRule` off or `isSoul` path check; torch kept: `torchConsumed` off or creative mode
@draft runnable steps not written yet; the next runner writes them from @commands
